<h1>Privacy</h1>
<p>
    Wagglesworth Estate doesn't have accounts, doesn't have comments, and doesn't ask
    you for anything.
</p>
<ul>
    <li>No cookies are set, and no analytics or tracking scripts run on this site.</li>
    <li>The only thing stored on your device is your text-size preference (A−/A+/Reset), saved locally in your browser so it's remembered next time you visit. It never leaves your device and this site never reads anyone else's copy of it.</li>
    <li>Real names and photos of the people who appear in these stories are used only with approval, and only under the familiar story names those people are known by here — never a full real name.</li>
</ul>
